### WebSocket endpoints (reference)
# Reference only — the REST Client protocol these files are written in
# cannot execute WebSocket requests, and this collection is REST-only by
# design (see tools/api/endpoints/api.http). For actually driving these
# endpoints end-to-end (login -> run_pipeline -> clarify -> completion),
# see the httpyac integration tests in tools/api/runs/*.http instead.
#
# ws://localhost:8000/ws/chat
# Sec-WebSocket-Protocol: bearer.{{jwt}}, flowin.v1
#
# ws://localhost:8000/ws/handoff/{{handoffToken}}
# Sec-WebSocket-Protocol: bearer.{{jwt}}, flowin.v1
